{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2d7ab40d31afebe9014919ccf5e90481181fb91e4f52185573c37ef229fb75ef", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD第三幕』の場当たりが\n始まった。みんなの歌も芝居も洗練されてきたな）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第三幕》的走台开始了。大家的歌唱和演技都越来越成熟了啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "ab0edf0f6ca8a5b1b76d9d48434dc3b7367b4eb2965e7d7d4dfa902f00932253", "ja": "いたいた、{$P$}！\nちょっと相談があるんだけど、今いい？", "zh": "找到你了，{$P$}！\n我有件事想和你商量，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e86445ba5a207eacf5386380a604d69d2956b1d90e7bd3265497268200de3bb", "ja": "どうしたんだ、昴？", "zh": "怎么了，昴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "e23c2c924d20254add538bfd379596cfe0813922cea836eb811bc677e862e795", "ja": "あのさ……。今さらなんだけど、\nオレの真珠星って、ちゃんとできてる？", "zh": "那个……虽然事到如今才问，\n我的“真珠星”，有好好表现出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7c2d2082266567ed8d7a529b428e1714cd9827de934dc656564646cf9b2aa311", "ja": "できてると思うけど……そういう質問を\nするって事は、昴自身はそう思えてないのか？", "zh": "我觉得已经完成了……不过，既然你会这么问，昴自己是不是觉得还没做好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "bbdec993da64e96cde2fdfcd7dac4a22831145347cc32daa8774121c9e7a8db3", "ja": "うん。桃子や星梨花の真珠星は、何度も見て\n確認したし。みんなとの練習もバッチリだった……。", "zh": "嗯。桃子和星梨花的珍珠星，我已经看过好多次确认过了。和大家一起练习也非常顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8e06fd75c0184c3087995ec0e11f55b5503538ee9fec82499dd2050ab062cb2", "ja": "だから間違ってないと思うんだけど、なんか\n気になっちゃってさー。本当にこれでいいのかなって。", "zh": "所以我觉得应该没错，但总觉得有点在意……真的这样就行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bad0a1325323fd6c04448f85b615d1c867f5bb5503d83fb34d386a4f3926a496", "ja": "そうか……。\nそれは、あまり良くないな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n那可不太妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "568a2e4ff33901b6ac822f9f882fa07b5b5cbf53a2db611031d7cdb00aa14020", "ja": "やっぱり！？　どうしよう{$P$}！\nオレ、みんなに迷惑かけたくないよ～！", "zh": "果然！？怎么办{$P$}！\n我不想给大家添麻烦啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6e0d7516a24d064309e4fa0bd0cbd1e7c2a66b419169ab97700cab43f3ccd05", "ja": "ごめんごめん、言葉が足りなかった。\nえーと、昴の気持ち次第で解決できると思うって事だ。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，是我没说清楚。\n呃，我是说，我觉得只要看昴自己的心情，应该就能解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "0ef7e0ee9e4b8b44bba586b7ef277f738e59e9ec1c1431a96d28230b55121a2f", "ja": "オレの気持ち？　どういうこと？", "zh": "我的心情？什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1212353aed8e922a1b61697258229ba1f55c29330212d92bd5b7ef0a5e3ad035", "ja": "うん。今の昴は、桃子や星梨花の真珠星と、\n違う真珠星にしちゃいけないと思ってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯。我觉得现在的昴，是不是认为自己的珍珠星不能和桃子、星梨花的珍珠星不一样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ec490530a2b94171eaf01b45382131506a252970b1611dffb6f08c66bd5ac261", "ja": "でもお芝居だからな。違ってもいいんだ。\n昴は、昴の真珠星をやればいいんだよ。", "zh": "不过这毕竟是在演戏。演得不一样也没关系。\n昴只要演好属于自己的珍珠星就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e1da72e8bed3dfb18b673fc3971c08abfc0ca0882e650892564ba98b03527d3d", "ja": "ファンの人達は、『昴の真珠星』が見たいはずだから。", "zh": "粉丝们应该是想看《昴的珍珠星》的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "2242b049d9674242ce12035e489dd117a5ad5a61307792af50fa6ecc241768b0", "ja": "オレ、桃子や星梨花の真珠星と違ったら、\nお客さんはガッカリすると思ってた……。", "zh": "我本来以为，要是和桃子、星梨花的珍珠星不一样，客人们会很失望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "824940474451a4a417c358b9ddb1a8d59281a04afad7c0ef717ba30dee20c2a5", "ja": "違っていいんだ……そっかぁ。", "zh": "与众不同也没关系啊……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1016_p", "source_sha256": "88e22fe7524f4160dd8ca8e58e00edf0eab457db4e00c6541bfa935177d033d0", "ja": "どうだ？　解決したか？", "zh": "怎么样？解决了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "06367fd25cc4f63543ecd4d3700b21b070321bc24bc1e21fa3c3bfbe759d91bd", "ja": "うーん、わかんないけど……\nでも、やるだけやってみる！", "zh": "嗯……虽然不知道行不行……\n但我会尽力试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "773c1cd041ea0e5925163ea05779956ffb7c06a90e67e30cc385f707c824633e", "ja": "{$P$}、\n相談のってくれてサンキュな♪", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你愿意听我商量♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0473_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3120f38e9c217eabb90f6d507de7352e4f399b0853b2d8a8cde4e81dbd456d57", "ja": "（その後、場当たりで昴が見せた演技は、より一層\n気持ちが入って見えた。……うん、本番が楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（之后，昴在走位彩排时展现的演技看起来更加投入了。……嗯，真期待正式演出啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
